# Arc gun: take it with the debug menu GIVE button, let round 1 zombies come close, fire into them, and clear the round.
debug GOD MODE
debug GIVE ARC GUN
wait 5
expect hud.weapon ARC GUN
expect hud.ammo 8 / 48
wait 40
shot 01-arc-gun
hold aim
wait 30
shot 02-aimed
release aim
until zombies.alive 4 300
wait 420
aim
tap fire
shot 03-arcs
expect hud.ammo 7 / 48
state 03-fired
fight_until hud.break true 3600
expect zombies.alive 0
state 04-cleared
shot 04-cleared
tap reload
wait 40
shot 05-reload
